e2**  \n\nEvaluation: Preparing kingside castling, defending d3, keeping position solid.  \nReason: Avoids opening the center prematurely when Black’s knights are active, and enables future K: e1–g1 after moving N out of g1.  \n\n**Answer: B: f1-e2**'}
